"Eat enough to get a nosebleed?" "The amount of sugar is the amount of love." "Oops, I made a mistake, this was salt!" Well, what a frenzy.

250
00:29:50,830 --> 00:29:57,310
正直ドキドキしてはいる 真心こめてラッピング 自分も本気コーデで行く
Honestly, my heart is pounding, wrapping it with true sincerity, going with my serious outfit too,

251
00:29:57,730 --> 00:29:59,890
祈るラビチャン!
Praying, Laby-chan!

252
00:30:11,870 --> 00:30:17,370
何度も試作した 予行練習もした
I've tried and tested, rehearsed it over and over...

253
00:30:17,720 --> 00:30:20,720
弱気になどなるな 大丈夫
Don't give in to timidity, it's alright...

254
00:30:21,170 --> 00:30:26,620
自分史上1番かわいい私なんだから！
Because I'm the cutest I've ever been in my life!

255
00:30:26,970 --> 00:30:32,420
君は私と結ばれます 結ばれる運命なのです
You are bound to be with me, it's our destined fate!

256
00:30:33,270 --> 00:30:36,220
本命あげちゃう めるてぃー！
I'll give you my true feelings, melting!

257
00:30:36,570 --> 00:30:44,320
誰にも渡さない大戦争 ときめいちゃいます？めるしー
The great war of not letting anyone have you—is my heart racing, mercy?

258
00:30:44,670 --> 00:30:49,870
それじゃ手とか繋いじゃう？内緒のデート すうぃーてぃー すうぃーてぃー キス
Shall we hold hands then? A secret date, sweetie sweetie kiss...

259
00:30:50,220 --> 00:30:57,170
甘くていいの すうぃーてぃー すうぃーてぃー ハグ こういうのがいいっしょ？ 初恋なんだもん
Sweet is fine, sweetie sweetie hug—isn't this kind of thing nice? Because it's our first love!

260
00:30:57,370 --> 00:31:00,570
絶対譲らない覚悟です 本気なのです
I'm fully resolved never to yield, I mean it!

261
00:31:00,870 --> 00:31:03,570
目を見て言って？君の気持ち
Look me in the eye and tell me your true feelings...

262
00:31:04,170 --> 00:31:13,570
ぴゅあら ぴゅあら ぴゅあら ぴゅあらぶ ぴゅあら ぴゅあら ぴゅあら ぴゅあらぶ
Pure-love, pure-love, pure-love, pure-love...

263
00:31:13,770 --> 00:31:18,070
ぴゅあら ぴゅあらぶ
Pure-love, pure-love...

264
00:31:27,270 --> 00:31:36,470
はーい、ということで、チョコたち3人の新曲でしたー！
Yay! So that was the three of us, Choco and everyone's new song!

265
00:31:36,470 --> 00:31:42,570
改めてまして、ノエル様、ラミィ様と、一緒にね、コラボ歌唱した
Once again, collaborating and singing together with Noel-sama and Lamy-sama...

266
00:31:42,570 --> 00:31:53,270
[Sign: 初恋大戦争] という新曲なんですけど、今回は作詞作曲をメダン様、そして
[Sign: Hatsukoi Daisensou] It's a new song. This time, we asked Medansy-sama for the lyrics and composition, and...

267
00:31:53,270 --> 00:31:57,070
編曲をYo-SK様に、お願いいたしました！
Yo-SK-sama for the arrangement!

268
00:31:57,070 --> 00:32:12,070
いや今回のテーマがバレンタインの日に、3人の可愛い女の子たちが1人の男の子を手に入れるためにバチバチにね、出し抜こうとするみたいな…
Yeah, the theme this time is that on Valentine's Day, three cute girls go all out to outmaneuver each other to win over a single boy...

269
00:32:12,070 --> 00:32:25,070
激アマな手の振り付けとなっておりまーす！
with super sweet hand choreography!

270
00:32:25,070 --> 00:32:32,070
いや何回も聴きたいな！ねえ、何回も聴いたら元気出るとこあるのかな…
I want to listen to it over and over! Right, listening to it gives you energy...

271
00:32:32,070 --> 00:32:45,070
こちらの楽曲は、この後24時から、2月の15日0時から各種音楽サイトにて配信されまーす！
This song will be available on various music sites starting tonight at midnight, February 15th at 0:00!

272
00:32:45,070 --> 00:32:57,070
聴けるー！そしてね、この配信後すぐに、この楽曲のMVが公開されまーす！
You can listen to it! And right after this stream, the MV for this song will be released!

273
00:32:57,070 --> 00:33:12,070
いやぜひぜひ皆様いっぱい聴いて、MVの方にも感想とかね、コメントいただけたら嬉しいなって思います！
We'd be so happy if everyone listens to it a lot and leaves your thoughts and comments on the MV!

274
00:33:12,070 --> 00:33:24,070
じゃあね、二人とも、今日はありがとう！お誕生日おめでとう！
Well, both of you, thank you so much for today! Happy birthday!

275
00:33:24,070 --> 00:33:32,070
引き続きね、頑張ってね！
Keep up the great work!

276
00:33:32,070 --> 00:33:36,070
それじゃあお皿ば、お皿ばじゃ、お皿ば！ありがとうー！
Well then, time to wrap up! Thank you!

277
00:33:37,070 --> 00:33:58,070
そして、ここからライブ後半となります！まだまだゲストパートとか、なんと最後に重大告知もあるので…
And from here, the second half of the live begins! We still have guest parts and even major announcements at the end...

278
00:33:58,070 --> 00:34:03,070
皆様、一緒に楽しんでいきましょう！それでは、次のゲストは…こちら！
Let's all enjoy it together! Well then, our next guest is... right here!

279
00:34:30,270 --> 00:34:33,570
[Title: 大人なフリして。]
[Title: 大人なふりして。]

280
00:34:30,270 --> 00:34:33,570
[Text: 作詞・作曲: s-num]
[Text: Lyrics & Composition: s-num]

281
00:34:48,570 --> 00:35:00,570
急に「会いたい」って いつものように準備してる 午前0時過ぎの 終電で向かうって返した
Suddenly wanting to see you, getting ready just like always—I replied that I'd catch the past-midnight last train and head over.

282
00:35:01,076 --> 00:35:05,356
急に「会いたい」って いつものように準備してる 午前0時過ぎの 終電で向かうって返信した やめときなよって言われても また会いに行く 会いたいから
Suddenly saying "I want to see you," getting ready just like always. I replied that I'd head over on the past-midnight last train. Even if you tell me to stop, I'm going to see you again because I want to see you.

283
00:35:06,976 --> 00:35:10,616
別々に落ち合う まちの空気は少し冷たい
The air in the town where we meet up separately is a bit cold.

284
00:35:10,796 --> 00:35:13,816
慣れないワイン 無理やり 飲み干してしまっては ふらっふわ
Forcing myself to down unfamiliar wine, I feel all wobbly and lightheaded.

285
00:35:13,996 --> 00:35:15,956
嫌われちゃったらどうしよう
What should I do if you end up hating me?

286
00:35:16,136 --> 00:35:20,696
下手にしちゃったらどうしよう
What should I do if I handle things clumsily?

287
00:35:20,896 --> 00:35:23,796
一滴も残したくない
I don't want to leave a single drop behind.

288
00:35:27,116 --> 00:35:30,376
ちょっと 期待して ねぇ ずっと 見栄はって ねぇ
Expecting a little bit, hey... Always putting up a front, hey...

289
00:35:30,556 --> 00:35:34,816
周りばかり気にして生きてる
Living while caring only about what those around us think.

290
00:35:35,136 --> 00:35:39,936
ちょっと優越感 でも なんか寂しくて あぁ
With a bit of a sense of superiority, but somehow feeling lonely, ah...

291
00:35:40,136 --> 00:35:43,656
本当の自分じゃない気がして
Feeling like this isn't my true self at all.

292
00:35:43,836 --> 00:35:46,596
いつも分かったフリして
Always pretending to understand.

293
00:35:46,776 --> 00:35:53,116
そんなんじゃないのに無理して 味のしないキスでも やっぱ一番嬉しくて
Forcing myself when I'm not like that at all. Even a tasteless kiss is still the happiest thing after all.

294
00:35:53,436 --> 00:35:57,936
取り繕ったさんはかわいいかな
Am I cute when I'm all put-on and artificial?

295
00:35:58,236 --> 00:36:02,696
今夜は壊れるほど抱きしめて
Tonight, hold me tight enough to break me.

296
00:36:12,916 --> 00:36:16,496
今にも切れそうな糸で繋がってる恋だね
It's a romance connected by a thread that looks like it could snap at any second.

297
00:36:16,676 --> 00:36:21,216
私が諦めたら きっと簡単に消えちゃうね
If I gave up, it would surely disappear so easily.

298
00:36:21,476 --> 00:36:26,316
引き止めるにはどうする？ あの子だったらどうする？
What should I do to make you stay? What would you do if it were that girl?

299
00:36:26,516 --> 00:36:29,476
不器用に指を絡めて
Clumsily intertwining our fingers.

300
00:36:31,636 --> 00:36:34,956
いつも チェックして ねぇ 一喜一憂で ねぇ
Always checking on you, hey... Riding an emotional rollercoaster, hey...

301
00:36:35,136 --> 00:36:39,676
他の子と比べてばかりいた
I was always comparing myself to other girls.

302
00:36:40,116 --> 00:36:44,896
一番見て欲しい あぁ 目の前のあなたは あぁ
Wanting you to look at me the most, ah... The you right in front of me, ah...

303
00:36:45,316 --> 00:36:47,156
どこか違う景色見てる？
Are you looking at some different scenery?

304
00:36:47,896 --> 00:36:51,696
いつも優しいフリして そんなんじゃないのに笑って
Always acting so kind, smiling even when I don't feel like it.

305
00:36:51,876 --> 00:36:56,796
近づけば近づくほど 心は遠く感じて
The closer I get, the more distant my heart feels.

306
00:36:57,076 --> 00:37:02,616
少しずつ離れてくことわかるよ 今夜は忘れるほど抱きしめて
I know we're drifting apart little by little. Tonight, hold me tight enough to forget everything.

307
00:37:17,896 --> 00:37:27,076
自分がもっと強ければ サヨナラを言えるのにな
If only I were a bit stronger, would I be able to say goodbye?

308
00:37:29,496 --> 00:37:37,896
いつも分かったフリして そんなんじゃないのに無理して ふと見せる優しさが ずっと忘れられなくて
Always pretending to understand, forcing myself when I'm not like that at all. The kindness you suddenly show is something I can never forget.

309
00:37:38,316 --> 00:37:46,896
取り繕った私はかわいいかな 今夜は壊れるほど抱きしめて
Am I cute when I'm all put-on and artificial? Tonight, hold me tight enough to break me.

310
00:37:47,896 --> 00:37:52,116
突然溢れ出した雨 私頑張ったよね
The rain that suddenly overflowed... I tried my best, didn't I?

311
00:37:52,896 --> 00:38:01,236
いつか振り向いてくれると思っていた もういっかな 取り繕った私が 流れてゆく
Thinking you'd turn around and notice me someday... Oh well. My put-on self is simply washing away.

312
00:38:01,896 --> 00:38:06,676
今夜は忘れるほど抱きしめて
Tonight, hold me tight enough to forget everything.

313
00:39:12,858 --> 00:39:15,058
[Title: chocolate box]

314
00:39:25,358 --> 00:39:28,658
なんかいつも眠そうだし なんかいつもつまんなそうだし
Somehow you always look sleepy, somehow you always look bored.

315
00:39:28,858 --> 00:39:32,158
なんかいつもヤバそうだし なんかいつもスマホいじってるし
Somehow you always look like you're in trouble, somehow you're always fiddling with your phone.

316
00:39:32,358 --> 00:39:35,458
ホントはテンション高いのに アタシといると超低めだし
Even though your energy is usually high, it drops super low when you're with me.

317
00:39:35,658 --> 00:39:38,758
なんなん自分ありえなくない？ 嫌い大嫌いどうでもいい！
Don't you think you're impossible? I hate you, I despise you, I don't care at all!

318
00:39:39,058 --> 00:39:42,358
だったらボクも言うけどさぁ！ ちっちゃいことで不機嫌だし
If that's how it is, I'll say it too: you get in a bad mood over the littlest things!

319
00:39:42,558 --> 00:39:45,558
怒らせたらすぐ泣くし ごめんねも許してくれないし
You cry right away when angered, and you won't forgive me even when I say sorry.

320
00:39:45,758 --> 00:39:49,758
その割に寂しがり屋だし ケロっとおはようとか言うし
Yet you get lonely so easily, and then say "Good morning" like it's nothing.

321
00:39:49,958 --> 00:39:52,558
あぁなんて罪深い人なんだ 知らん知らん知らん知らんぞ！
Ah, what a sinful person you are. I don't know, I don't know, I don't know anything about it!

322
00:39:52,758 --> 00:39:57,058
甘い甘い 恋の魔法箱 宇宙味の秘密のチョコレート
Sweet, sweet magic box of love, secret universe-flavored chocolate.

323
00:39:57,358 --> 00:40:00,839
ふたりだけの
Just for the two of us...

324
00:40:01,019 --> 00:40:05,479
二人だけのデコレーションを散りばめて彩って食べちゃおうか！
Let's add our own decorations, scatter them, and eat them up!

325
00:40:06,019 --> 00:40:09,679
苦い苦い愛の玉手箱
A bitter, bitter treasure box of love,

326
00:40:09,829 --> 00:40:13,279
未来味の不思議なチョコレート
a mysterious chocolate with the taste of the future,

327
00:40:13,279 --> 00:40:19,499
温めて混ぜたらきっといつかお口に合う味になるの
Warm it and mix it, and I'm sure it will eventually become a flavor that suits your palate.

328
00:40:20,259 --> 00:40:21,979
「ねぇねぇ、ちょっといいかな。」
"Hey, hey, do you have a second?"

329
00:40:22,099 --> 00:40:23,379
「さっきはあのね、ごめんね…。」
"About just now, sorry..."

330
00:40:23,519 --> 00:40:25,439
「いつもモヤってなるじゃん？」
"You always leave me feeling all fuzzy and confused, right?"

331
00:40:25,619 --> 00:40:27,939
「今日はこれを渡したくて…。言葉じゃ足りないからさ、」
"Today I wanted to give you this... since words aren't enough,"

332
00:40:28,339 --> 00:40:31,739
「受け取ってくれないかな。」「なにを！！！！」「一緒にいてくれてありがとう」
"Won't you accept it?" "What?!" "Thank you for being here with me."

333
00:40:34,039 --> 00:40:40,599
アナタの優しさについつい甘えちゃう誰よりも近いから素直になれない
I keep leaning into your kindness; since you're closer than anyone, I can't be honest.

334
00:40:40,759 --> 00:40:47,179
キミの一生懸命さをついつい忘れちゃう誰よりも一番大好きなのに
I tend to forget your earnest efforts, even though I love you more than anyone else.

335
00:40:47,739 --> 00:40:53,919
甘い甘い夢の宝箱奇跡味の内緒のチョコレート
A sweet, sweet treasure box of dreams, a miraculous-tasting secret chocolate,

336
00:40:54,139 --> 00:41:00,699
二人だけのイノベーションを探し組み立てたら賑わおうか！
if we search for and build an innovation just for the two of us, let's make it lively!

337
00:41:01,059 --> 00:41:07,439
苦い苦い日々の化粧箱世界味の最初のチョコレート
A bitter, bitter vanity case of daily life, world-flavored first chocolate,

338
00:41:07,859 --> 00:41:16,379
冷め切って割れないように大事に包んで生涯の完成まで
wrapped carefully so it doesn't cool and break—until our lifetime is complete.

339
00:41:29,299 --> 00:41:35,879
いつだって病める時もどんな日もそうずっと
Always, in sickness as well, on any day, always like this,

340
00:41:36,519 --> 00:41:42,639
健やかなる時も手を取って死が二人を分かつまで
taking each other's hand in health as well, until death do us part.

341
00:41:42,959 --> 00:41:46,179
愛してる僕もそうさ
"I love you." "Me too."

342
00:41:46,699 --> 00:41:49,639
傍にいて傍にいる
"Stay by my side." "I am by your side."

343
00:41:50,039 --> 00:41:53,319
なんて嘘かもよ？あぁそうかい、ボクも適当に言った
"Or maybe that's a lie?" "Oh is that so, I just said that casually too."

344
00:41:56,099 --> 00:41:59,579
甘い甘い？苦い苦い？
Sweet, sweet? Bitter, bitter?

345
00:41:59,779 --> 00:42:06,579
甘い甘い恋の魔法箱宇宙味の秘密のチョコレート二人だけのデコレーションを
Sweet, sweet magic box of love, secret chocolate tasting of the universe, decorations just for the two of us,

346
00:42:06,699 --> 00:42:12,619
散りばめて彩って食べちゃおうか！
let's scatter them, color them, and eat them up!

347
00:42:13,019 --> 00:42:19,799
苦い苦い愛の玉手箱未来味の不思議なチョコレート温めて混ぜたら絶対
A bitter, bitter treasure box of love, mysterious chocolate tasting of the future, warm it and mix it, absolutely...

348
00:42:22,899 --> 00:42:28,599
いつか最高に幸せな味になるの
one day it will become the happiest taste.

349
00:42:49,959 --> 00:42:54,579
いっせーのーでっ Thank you so much！
On the count of three, thank you so much!

350
00:43:39,039 --> 00:43:44,939
ねえ、ひとつだけ聞いていい？私のこと…
Hey, can I ask you just one thing? About me...

351
00:43:45,839 --> 00:43:50,339
[Title: 告白日和、です！]
[Title: Kokuhaku Biyori, desu!]

352
00:43:50,899 --> 00:44:01,339
会えるかも今日は心が騒いでスキップしたくなったときめきに踊る瞬間
Can we meet today? My heart is racing, I wanted to skip, a moment dancing with excitement.

353
00:44:01,639 --> 00:44:12,639
私のことなどたぶん気にしてないのだけど…ここにいるんだよ私はここよ
You probably don't care about me at all, but... I'm right here, I am right here.

354
00:44:12,839 --> 00:44:23,339
自信が揺れ動く嫌われてないかな？勢いでとにかく挨拶だ！
My confidence wavers—do they hate me? Whatever, let's just greet them with momentum!

355
00:44:24,839 --> 00:44:30,839
やっと晴れたねぱーっと晴れたねそして元気になるね
It finally cleared up, suddenly cleared up, and we feel energized!

356
00:44:30,839 --> 00:44:41,839
おはようの代わりに背中を叩いて「さあ、行くよ！」やっと晴れたらぱーっと晴れたらきっと元気なえがお
Patting each other on the back instead of saying good morning, "Here we go!" If it finally clears up, if it suddenly clears up, surely a cheerful smile.

357
00:44:41,839 --> 00:44:49,339
なんだか今のこの気持ちが切なくなったよ
Somehow, this feeling right now became a little bittersweet.

358
00:44:52,839 --> 00:45:01,839
授業も上の空遠くを眺めた恋って甘いもんじゃない？
Zoning out during class, gazing into the distance—isn't love not just sweet things?

359
00:45:04,136 --> 00:45:06,806
世界は恋に落ちている
The world is falling in love...

360
00:45:06,806 --> 00:45:11,606
光の矢胸を射す
...as an arrow of light pierces my heart.

361
00:45:11,606 --> 00:45:16,306
君を分かりたいんだよ ねえ
I want to understand you, hey...

362
00:45:16,306 --> 00:45:21,106
教えて触れた指先が遠くて
Tell me, why are our touching fingertips so far apart?

363
00:45:21,106 --> 00:45:24,106
駆け抜けた日々に
In the days we ran through...

364
00:45:24,106 --> 00:45:27,206
忘れられない思い出を全部見せてよ
Show me all of our unforgettable memories.

365
00:45:53,996 --> 00:45:56,566
世界は恋に落ちている
The world is falling in love...

366
00:45:56,566 --> 00:46:01,496
光の矢胸を射す
...as an arrow of light pierces my heart.

367
00:46:01,496 --> 00:46:06,306
君を分かりたいんだよ ねえ
I want to understand you, hey...

368
00:46:06,306 --> 00:46:11,176
教えて触れた指先が遠くて
Tell me, why are our touching fingertips so far apart?

369
00:46:11,176 --> 00:46:16,036
本当は不安でも勇気出そう
Even if I'm scared, I'll summon my courage.

370
00:46:16,036 --> 00:46:19,046
出そう
Yes, summon it!

371
00:46:20,226 --> 00:46:24,216
ずっと前からずっと前から
Ever since long ago, ever since long ago...

372
00:46:24,216 --> 00:46:28,556
気になってたこと答えてよ
Give me an answer to what I've been wondering about!

373
00:46:28,556 --> 00:46:33,226
どんな風に感じてるの全部見せてよ
Show me everything about how you feel.

374
00:46:45,856 --> 00:46:50,856
太陽共犯者
The sun is our accomplice...

375
00:46:50,856 --> 00:46:55,866
ひそひそ声がリンクする
...as our whispering voices link together.

376
00:46:55,866 --> 00:47:00,866
